#: cel.i18n.php:16
msgid ""
"Setting this true will enable the CEL module to create call reports from CEL "
"data. Although the CEL module will assure there is a CEL table available, "
"the reporting functionality in Asterisk and associated ODBC database and CEL "
"configuration must be done outside of FreePBX either by the user or at the "
"Distro level."
msgstr ""
"將此設為 true 將使 CEL 模組能從 CEL 資料建立通話報告。雖然 CEL 模組將確保有可用的 CEL 資料表，但 Asterisk 中的報告功能及相關 ODBC 資料庫與 CEL 設定必須在 FreePBX 之外由使用者或在 Distro 層級完成。"

